## Important scope restriction

This is an MVP/prototype.

Do NOT implement:

* liveness detection
* anti-spoofing
* deepfake detection
* production identity verification
* database-backed biometric identification
* multi-person identification
* automatic document-type classification
* advanced document authenticity detection
* government-ID validation
* cloud biometric services

These can be added later.

The immediate goal is simply:

UPLOAD DOCUMENT
↓
FIND FACE
+
EXTRACT NAME
↓
OPEN CAMERA
↓
FIND LIVE FACE
↓
GENERATE EMBEDDINGS
↓
COSINE SIMILARITY
↓
COMPARE NAME
↓
RETURN VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED

Build the project incrementally. First make static-image face detection and comparison work, then OCR, then camera input, then FastAPI integration, then the simple UI.

At every stage provide runnable code rather than pseudocode.
